  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<color=#FFC800><b>OBJECTIVE</b></color>

    Escape the containment lab through the main gate.



    <color=#FFC800><b>WHAT TO DO</b></color>

    1. Hit the button to the left of the capsules with your tongue. It opens the capsule doors for the other players.

    2. Find the switch in another room. It stops the vent smoke and powers up the laser switch.

    3. Hit the laser switch to turn off the lasers near the gate. <color=#FF5050><b>The lasers are deadly!</b></color>

    4. Put a frog or a cube on each of the 2 pressure plates at the same time to open the gate.

    5. Get every frog through the gate to escape. (Singleplayer just escape)



    <color=#FFC800><b>CONTROLS</b></color>

    <b>WASD / Left Stick:</b> Move

    <b>Mouse / Right Stick:</b> Look

    <b>Mouse Wheel:</b> Zoom

    <b>Left Shift / L3:</b> Switch between run and hop

    <b>Hold Space / A:</b> Charge and aim a jump, let go to jump

    <b>Left Click / RT:</b> Shoot tongue, press buttons, grab cubes

    <b>Hold Right Click / LT:</b> Reel in what your tongue holds

    <b>E / X:</b> Stick to a wall or let go

    <b>Q / B:</b> Break free from another frog''s tongue

    <b>Esc / Start:</b> Pause menu

    <b>Tab:</b> Free the mouse'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
